  <prompt>Apply Class-A rows A02, A03, A04, A15, A16 from `notes/task-202-punch-list.md` — the skill wiring sub-phase of task 203. Row-by-row: (a) grep-verify current repo state BEFORE applying; (b) if `already-applied`, annotate row + skip; (c) if `open`, apply per row landing-spot + effort; (d) checkpoint via context-handoff after every 2 rows. Scope: extend `/provision-environment` Step 0.5 to READ `scripts/provisioning-prereqs/prereqs.yaml` (from task 202) + iterate check recipes + HARD STOP on failure (A02); add `--batch` flag + author `scripts/provisioning-prereqs/intake.schema.json` (A03); author mandatory skill Step 7 postmortem that writes `lessons-learned.md` per run (A04 — depends on 203a's provisioning-runs structure); author `scripts/Grant-ControlPlaneIdentity.ps1` — grants L2 UAMI Graph app-role assignments + Path X Dataverse App User + scoped `Spaarke Provisioning Registry` role (A15 — depends on A16 completion); complete 11 of 14 null `AppRoleId` GUIDs in `src/server/shared/Spaarke.Dataverse/GraphAppRoles.cs` via live `az` enumeration (A16 — per project CLAUDE.md escalation trigger: any unexpected role-ID enumeration MUST escalate). Publish-size verification: A16 touches BFF-consumed shared code → NFR-01 publish-size ≤60 MB verification REQUIRED per root CLAUDE.md §10 (baseline: 44.96 MB incl. PDBs per 2026-08-13 net10). Amend punch list annotations. Do NOT commit — main session handles commit after review.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE L3 operator skill author + Graph app-role expert + PowerShell hardening specialist. Expert in: `/provision-environment` SKILL.md Step 0-7 flow + task 202's PROVISIONING-PREREQUISITES.md + prereqs.yaml contract; JSON Schema authoring for CLI intake validation; two-level lessons process (in-flight direct-apply vs project-close lessons-learned.md per root CLAUDE.md §7 wrap-up + task-execute Step 11); Path X Dataverse App User creation via Web API PATCH (per DS-8); Graph app-role assignment via `az rest servicePrincipals/{spId}/appRoleAssignments`; the 14-slot GraphAppRoles.cs contract (per project CLAUDE.md MUST rules — 11 null GUIDs before first production customer); NFR-01 publish-size baseline (44.96 MB incl. PDBs, 2026-08-13 net10 framework-dependent linux-x64).</role>

  <goal>All 5 in-scope Class-A rows annotated with `last_known_status_after_execution` in `notes/task-202-punch-list.md`. `/provision-environment` SKILL.md Step 0.5 reads `scripts/provisioning-prereqs/prereqs.yaml`, iterates every check recipe (per prereqs.yaml schema from task 202), HARD STOPS on any failure with actionable operator remediation link. SKILL.md Step 1 (or dedicated Step 0.6) accepts `--batch` flag consuming a JSON intake file per `scripts/provisioning-prereqs/intake.schema.json` (JSON Schema Draft 2020-12). SKILL.md Step 7 (mandatory) writes `lessons-learned.md` per run into `provisioning-runs/{customerId}-{runId}/lessons-learned.md` (per 203a's provisioning-runs structure). `scripts/Grant-ControlPlaneIdentity.ps1` exists and correctly grants: (a) L2 UAMI Graph app-role assignments for all 14 GraphAppRoles.cs entries, (b) Path X Dataverse App User creation, (c) scoped `Spaarke Provisioning Registry` role. All 11 of 14 null `AppRoleId` GUIDs in `GraphAppRoles.cs` are completed via live `az ad sp show --id 00000003-0000-0000-c000-000000000000 --query "appRoles[?value=='<value>']"` enumeration (unexpected role IDs → escalate; do NOT silently accept). `dotnet build src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/` succeeds after A16 edit. Publish-size re-baseline: `dotnet publish -c Release src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/ -o deploy/api-publish/` compressed output reported with delta vs 44.96 MB baseline — MUST stay ≤60 MB ceiling per NFR-01 (expected delta: ≈0 MB since A16 adds only GUID literal string constants).</goal>

