  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Rigor + load">Emit RIGOR LEVEL block (FULL, xhigh effort). Read `notes/task-202-punch-list.md` §CLASS A rows A02, A03, A04, A15, A16. Read `.claude/skills/provision-environment/SKILL.md` current Step 0-7 flow. Read `docs/guides/PROVISIONING-PREREQUISITES.md` + `scripts/provisioning-prereqs/prereqs.yaml`. Read `GraphAppRoles.cs` and count null slots.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Grep-verify each row BEFORE applying">For each row A02, A03, A04, A15, A16: run row-specific grep against target files. Record verified status in scratchpad table BEFORE any edit. Count null AppRoleId slots in GraphAppRoles.cs; if not 11 (already partially filled), reconcile against source-of-truth before proceeding with A16.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Verify 203a dependency for A04">Grep for `provisioning-runs/_templates/lessons-learned.md` — if absent, MARK A04 `deferred-because-203a-not-yet-landed` + skip A04. Otherwise proceed.</step>
    <step order="3" name="A16 apply — GraphAppRoles.cs 11 null GUIDs (do FIRST, blocks A15)">Read GraphAppRoles.cs; enumerate 11 null slots. For each, run `az ad sp show --id 00000003-0000-0000-c000-000000000000 --query "appRoles[?value=='<value>']" -o json` and record enumerated GUID + cross-check against Microsoft-documented Graph app-role catalog. If ALL 11 enumerate cleanly + match precedent, EDIT GraphAppRoles.cs to fill in the GUIDs. If ANY unexpected → STOP + escalate per project CLAUDE.md §Human Escalation Triggers.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Publish-size verification post-A16">Run `dotnet build src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/` (must succeed) then `dotnet publish -c Release src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/ -o deploy/api-publish/`. Measure compressed output + record absolute size + delta vs 44.96 MB baseline. Expected delta ≈0 MB.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Checkpoint (after 1 row + build/publish)">Run `context-handoff`.</step>
    <step order="6" name="A15 apply — Grant-ControlPlaneIdentity.ps1">Author `scripts/Grant-ControlPlaneIdentity.ps1` with header citing punch list row A15 + §11 justification. Reference all 14 GraphAppRoles GUIDs (now filled from A16). Include: (a) `az rest servicePrincipals/{spId}/appRoleAssignments` calls for Graph app-role assignments to L2 UAMI, (b) Path X Dataverse App User creation via Web API PATCH per DS-8, (c) scoped `Spaarke Provisioning Registry` role assignment. Add `-WhatIf` support + dry-run mode.</step>
    <step order="7" name="A03 apply — --batch + intake.schema.json">Author `scripts/provisioning-prereqs/intake.schema.json` (JSON Schema Draft 2020-12) covering profile enum, customerId, tenantId, environmentId, region, tier. EDIT SKILL.md Step 1 to accept `--batch <path-to-json>` bypassing interactive intake — value MUST validate against the JSON Schema before proceeding.</step>
    <step order="8" name="A02 apply — Step 0.5 external prereqs reader">EDIT SKILL.md Step 0.5 to READ `scripts/provisioning-prereqs/prereqs.yaml` + iterate every check-recipe key + execute each check + HARD STOP on any failure with actionable operator remediation link (link INTO `docs/guides/PROVISIONING-PREREQUISITES.md` fragment).</step>
    <step order="9" name="Checkpoint (after 3 rows)">Run `context-handoff`.</step>
    <step order="10" name="A04 apply — Step 7 postmortem (conditional on 203a)">IF 203a landed (per Step 2 check): EDIT SKILL.md to author mandatory Step 7 that writes `provisioning-runs/{customerId}-{runId}/lessons-learned.md` per run. Template MUST reference 203a's per-run lessons-learned.md template. Include triggering conditions (Ready reached / gate failure / abort). Otherwise skip + annotate.</step>
    <step order="11" name="Build + test">Run `dotnet build src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/` — must succeed. Run any existing GraphAppRoles unit tests (if present).</step>
    <step order="12" name="Amend punch list annotations">EDIT `notes/task-202-punch-list.md` — add `last_known_status_after_execution` per row A02, A03, A04, A15, A16. Append §203c execution results subsection with GraphAppRoles enumerated GUID list + BFF publish-size delta report + A04 deferral status (if any).</step>
    <step order="13" name="Report">Emit concise summary: rows applied, rows already-applied, rows deferred (with reason), publish-size + delta reported, GraphAppRoles enumeration outcomes (all matched / any escalated), A04 deferral status. Do NOT commit — main session handles commit after review.</step>
