  <notes>Justification (CLAUDE.md §11): Existing — task 202 authored the punch list + prereqs.yaml + PROVISIONING-PREREQUISITES.md; 203a authored `provisioning-runs/_templates/`. This task consumes all three. Extension — 203c wires the skill to the codified prereqs (Step 0.5), enables batch mode (Step 1 flag), enforces mandatory postmortem (Step 7), and provides operator-bootstrap script (A15) + completes the long-standing GraphAppRoles null GUIDs (A16). Cost-of-doing-nothing — without Step 0.5 the operator manually verifies prereqs each run (SESSION 5 failure mode); without --batch the skill cannot be automated; without Step 7 the two-level lessons process is one-level only (no per-run postmortem); without Grant-ControlPlaneIdentity.ps1 operator bootstrap remains manual `az` toil; without GraphAppRoles GUIDs H10 cannot complete for the first production customer (BINDING per project CLAUDE.md MUST rules). NFR-01 publish-size verification REQUIRED per §10 (baseline 44.96 MB; expected delta ≈0 MB).</notes>

